# Executor Agents

Use the executor matching the changed area:

- `web-agent`: `src/`, `rspack.config.cjs`, web e2e.
- `mobile-agent`: `mobile/`.
- `backend-agent`: `server/`.
- `shared-contract-agent`: `shared/` plus all API consumers.
- `design-agent`: UI/UX decisions before implementation.
- `autotest-agent`: test implementation.

Each executor returns changed files, verification commands, risks, and next
review owner.
